cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "TAVE - Tokenized Asset Valuation Engine: event-study pipeline and valuation tool"
abstract: >-
  Replication code for a five-channel framework mapping enterprise asset
  tokenization onto the weighted average cost of capital, an event study of
  1,169 verified tokenization announcements by 35 listed firms (2021-2025),
  and an open-source valuation tool implementing the framework.
type: software
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/FelixDLanger/tave-event-study"
authors:
  - family-names: Langer
    given-names: Felix D.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3205-8088"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher; Doctoral Candidate (DBA), GlobalNxt University"
keywords:
  - tokenization
  - cost of capital
  - event study
  - illiquidity premium
  - real-world assets
preferred-citation:
